    sa: ["In a few sentences, explain how a Christian should live as a citizen.", ["christ first", "welfare", "pray", "honest", "justice", "serve"], "A good answer says a Christian belongs first to Christ and seeks the welfare of their community by praying for leaders, obeying just laws, paying what is owed, acting with integrity, serving, working for peace and justice, and obeying God above all."],
