    apply: "Write your personal covenant and share it with a trusted friend or leader. Join or form a group to keep serving your community. Teach one lesson to someone else. Memorise Philippians 1:27. Share your plan with a trusted friend or family member this week and ask them to check in with you, then thank God for any progress.",
